<p>Speaking yesterday at the ILS Bermuda Convergence 2026 conference, Bob Smith, President &#38; Co-CIO of fixed income and alternative solutions manager Sage Advisory, explained that he sees insurance-linked securities as an asset class that can expand the horizon of impact investing. Smith is a strong proponent for investing into catastrophe bonds and other natural catastrophe [&#8230;]</p>
<p><a href="https://www.artemis.bm/news/insurance-linked-securities-expand-the-horizon-for-impact-investing-smith-sage-advisory/">Insurance-linked securities expand the horizon for impact investing: Smith, Sage Advisory</a> was published by: <a href="https://www.artemis.bm">www.Artemis.bm</a><br />
